Fixes applied to the baseline export (workflow-mini-apps 55cd20f + KR-01) before goldens
are captured. harness.baseline_tree() applies this file to a copy of the export, so the
goldens compare the integrated examples with a baseline that carries the same fixes.

- HDF5 I/O (motif_2/3/4/6): every task reads ./data_0.h5, created first by the script
  and sized to the largest read in the config, and writes its own file
  (filename_suffix). This fixes motif_2's first stage failing in a fresh directory
  and the shared-file lock race between parallel tasks.

